STEP 4 — option 124: `ip dhcp-client vendor-identifying-class`
================================================================================
      awplus(config-if)# ip dhcp-client vendor-identifying-class    (cfg.py exit 0)
  leg `vic`:
      DISCOVER opt vendor_class = 000000cf 01 01
               (= DHCP option 124, Vendor-Identifying Vendor Class)

  Decoded: enterprise number 0x000000cf = **207**, the IANA Private Enterprise Number for
